A primitive man lived and died by his harvest.

00:57:21.600 --> 00:57:25.700
The purpose of his spring ceremonies was to ensure a plentiful autumn.

00:57:25.780 --> 00:57:30.000
Relics of these fertility dramas are to be found all over the world.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:34.900
